{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrinkle Your Brain  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials is an all-ages, arcade-style block-dropping puzzle game that will supercharge your math skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/7d825d0393e720666dd3bab7f4f33814.poster.avif?t=1758324793\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/7d825d0393e720666dd3bab7f4f33814.webm?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/7d825d0393e720666dd3bab7f4f33814.mp4?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: arrange the falling number blocks to form rows or columns that equal the target number. As the blocks keep falling, you\u2019ll need lightning-quick thinking to make it through. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >41 Ways to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock in Timed Mode or plot your victory with Puzzle Mode. Choose from 6 or 7 different math subjects, ranging from addition to algebra. There is sum-thing for everyone!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/d8b070a0e9f95a39982d4f4d65c88dea.poster.avif?t=1758324793\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/d8b070a0e9f95a39982d4f4d65c88dea.webm?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/d8b070a0e9f95a39982d4f4d65c88dea.mp4?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game caters to all skill levels, making it a perfect choice for students and math enthusiasts alike. Whether you\u2019re a beginner looking for a fun way to practice or a literal calculator looking for a challenge, Times Trials is right for you.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >School Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double the fun with Versus Mode! Take your skills to the next power by squaring off against friends and family. Who will be the better mathematician? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/726896178c3471296a3c6d8615dbc7d5.poster.avif?t=1758324793\" width=780 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/726896178c3471296a3c6d8615dbc7d5.webm?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/726896178c3471296a3c6d8615dbc7d5.mp4?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide cast of lovable characters who will help you add fun to your math practice.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/84b7219fcf829552e40db1326988c204.poster.avif?t=1758324793\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351640/extras/84b7219fcf829552e40db1326988c204.webm?t=1758324793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by Excellent People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times Trials has had the honor to have industry veterans be a part of the development. These veterans have come from companies such as Disney and 